OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet start to the week with
OL,6,Frain, heavy at times, persisting
OL,7,Fthrough much of the morning. Rain
OL,8,Fpushes northeastwards by afternoon
OL,9,Fallowing brighter spells to develop.
OL,10,FWinds strengthen through the morning,
OL,11,Fbecoming particularly gusty over high
OL,12,Fground.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA mostly dry evening, then a
OL,15,Fband of heavy rain sweeps through
OL,16,Fquickly overnight, only lingering in
OL,17,Fthe east by dawn. Winds continue to
OL,18,Fstrengthen through the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
